{"4374730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red: Flame & Fable", "steam_appid": 4374730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/d71da20ee28ba677f2bfe9887c6e88fe.avif?t=1778032575\" width=972 height=171 /></span>   Red grew up in a cottage with her family on the outskirts of a vast forest, safe and quiet. The woods are not as safe as they had always appeared from Red's window however... On one fateful day, Red finds herself alone, her parents consumed by a terrible floral curse that had crawled out from between the trees. <br><br>   Armed with an old lantern that her mother managed to give her before the curse took hold, Red must dive into the woods where the curse originated, seeking help from a certain family member that she had never met before.  <br> <br>   Cursed animals stalk these glades, and a wolf appears to roam amongst the shadows, never drawing attention, yet always watching... In order to survive Red must cling to the light of her lantern, fight back against the monsters and expose the secrets of the flower curse to free the forest and her family from its grasp.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/9bb539e11f439e0b278db378d9f00e5c.avif?t=1778032575\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras_big/9bb539e11f439e0b278db378d9f00e5c.webp?t=1778032575 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/08b23acc879e429874bd083490da2db0.avif?t=1778032575\" width=972 height=171 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Avoid the encroaching darkness by using your lantern<br>- Fight relentless monsters in dark combat arenas<br>- Defeat terrifying bosses that reveal the lore of the flower curse<br>- Navigate the platforming challenges &amp; explore handcrafted, detailed environemnts<br>- Discover collectibles &amp; alternative flowers that enhance Red's power in combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/9d5c986dfed1119ce8145ed96cb15b84.poster.avif?t=1778032575\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/9d5c986dfed1119ce8145ed96cb15b84.webm?t=1778032575\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/9d5c986dfed1119ce8145ed96cb15b84.mp4?t=1778032575\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/5b6534b96bc3353e88fcf1b7c112979c.avif?t=1778032575\" width=972 height=171 /></span>- 6 handcrafted story-rich levels 🌲🌳🏕️<br> - Exciting &amp; challenging combat ⚔️<br>- 5+ creepy monster enemies to encounter and defeat 💀 <br>- 3 varied flower types to amplify Red's power 🌷🌹🌸🌺<br>- Multiple endings ⇄<br>- Over 20 collectibles &amp; secrets to be discovered 🔍<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/c11ee08c1e92243def05270ea4640eee.poster.avif?t=1778032575\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4374730/extras/c11ee08c1e92243def0527